<title>USA: Autauga Cty BOE, Ala., $6.250 mln won by Regions Investment Co. [CORRECTED 00:13 GMT 28/2]</title>
<headline>Autauga Cty BOE, Ala., $6.250 mln won by Regions Investment Co. [CORRECTED 00:13 GMT 28/2]</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Corrects company name in headline and text from Robinson Humphrey Co. Inc)</p>
<p>Regions Investment Co said it won $6.250 million of Autauga Cty BOE, Ala., capital outlay school warrants, Series 1997-A, with a net interest cost of 5.50126 (corrects) percent.</p>
